{
  "name": "Monitor Target Accounts for Hiring Velocity, Salary Bands & JD Tech Signals (6 ATS)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Monitor Target Accounts for 6-ATS Hiring Velocity, Salary & Tech Signals\n\n### How it works\nThis workflow tracks hiring velocity, salary benchmarks, and job-description tech signals across six major ATS platforms every week:\n1. **Weekly Schedule Trigger** and **Set Target Accounts** initiate monitoring for your target company domains (or work emails).\n2. **Screen 6-ATS Hiring Signals** calls `POST /screen` on RapidAPI (`unified-multi-ats-jobs-salary-hiring-intelligence`) to auto-detect boards across Ashby, Greenhouse, Lever, SmartRecruiters, Workday, and BambooHR and return open role counts, median USD salaries, remote share, and 135+ JD tech-stack signals. **Split Out Company Summaries** separates each company item.\n3. **Filter Active Hiring Accounts** keeps accounts with `status = ok` and at least `5` open roles.\n4. **Format Hiring Signal Digest** extracts company, ATS, open role count, median USD salary, and top tech skills, and **Send Hiring Signal Alert to Slack** posts alerts to `#hiring-signals`.\n\n### Setup\n1. Subscribe to the free Basic plan on RapidAPI (`unified-multi-ats-jobs-salary-hiring-intelligence`).\n2. Create a **Header Auth** credential named `RapidAPI Key` (`x-rapidapi-key`) and select it in **Screen 6-ATS Hiring Signals**.\n3. Connect your **Slack** credential and select your destination channel in **Send Hiring Signal Alert to Slack**.\n4. Edit the company list in **Set Target Accounts** and test the workflow.\n\n### Customization\n- Lower or raise the `totalOpenJobs >= 5` threshold in **Filter Active Hiring Accounts** to match your territory size.\n- Pipe **Format Hiring Signal Digest** into **HubSpot**, **Salesforce**, or **Notion** alongside Slack for account-level hiring history.",
        "height": 640,
        "width": 460,
        "color": 1
      },
      "id": "ats-jo-overview-note",
      "name": "Workflow Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -520,
        40
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 1. Weekly Trigger & Target Accounts\nRuns on a weekly schedule and defines the target company domains or work emails to monitor.",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 460,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "rol-sec-1",
      "name": "Step 1: Schedule & Accounts",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -20,
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 2. Screen 6-ATS Boards & Split\nAuto-detects Ashby, Greenhouse, Lever, SmartRecruiters, Workday, and BambooHR boards in one `POST /screen` call, then splits company summaries.",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 500,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "rol-sec-2",
      "name": "Step 2: Screen 6 ATS",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        480,
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 3. Filter Hiring Velocity & Format\nKeeps accounts with `status = ok` and `>= 5` open roles, then formats ATS name, role count, median USD salary, and top JD tech signals.",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 500,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "rol-sec-3",
      "name": "Step 3: Filter & Format",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1020,
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 4. Send Hiring Alert to Slack\nPosts each active hiring account's digest directly to `#hiring-signals`.",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 320,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "rol-sec-4",
      "name": "Step 4: Slack Alert",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1560,
        60
      ]
    },
    {
